{"id":"u-2b49b12d-9b23-4f9d-bc9e-653d7e15ca24","src":"community","title":"5/3/1  Forever 5's PRO, FSL (Anchor)","author":"IronReep3r","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/1wYH1t-531-forever-5s-pro-ssl-leader-1","desc":"First Set Last (FSL) is one of the most popular and simplest templates from 5/3/1 Forever, where you do 5x5 of your first set as supplemental. It is usually done as either a leader for 2-3 cycles or as an anchor for SSL. Wendler recommends doing 5's PRO on main sets, meaning you do 5 reps across all main sets (instead of 5, 3, 1+). Recommended starting weight is 85-90% of TM.\n\nThe recommended assistance work for this template is 50-100 reps of Push, Pull and Single Leg/Abs every session. I have stayed within Jim's suggestions and chosen movements that best fits my weaknesses and schedule, but you are free to change the assistance work to best fit your preference. I do recommend not exceeding the recommended amounts of reps though.\n\nFor conditioning, the recommended amount for FSL is 2-3 hard sessions and 3-5 easy sessions each week.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":6,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-24T02:43:31.809Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Safety Bar Squat","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":70,"x":6},{"r":5,"pct":80},{"r":5,"pct":90}]},{"n":"Good Morning","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":70,"x":6},{"r":5,"pct":80},{"r":5,"pct":90}]},{"n":"Abs Crunch (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Behind-the-Neck Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}